## Architecture (mirrors the accepted VehicleCostPage gold-standard)
  - @MainActor @Observable CommandHistoryPageModel consumes an injectable
    `CommandHistoryDataSource` seam (production binds the shared KMP store, ADR-004;
    SampleCommandHistoryDataSource is the preview/standalone default). View holds no networking.
  - All chrome via P2 design tokens (Color.TS / Font.TS / TSSpacing / TSRadius) and P3 shared
    components (TSStatCard, TSGlassPanel, TSTabs, TSTimeline, TSEmptyState, TSErrorDisplay,
    TSStatGridSkeleton, TSTableSkeleton, TSVehicleSelect, TSPagination, TSPanelTitle, TSCaption).
  - Adaptive macOS (regular) / iPhone (compact) via horizontalSizeClass (ADR-002/006).
  - Command history is a polled REST query (GET /vehicles/{id}/commands/history) — NOT a live SSE
    source — so no >2min staleness indicator applies (ADR-013 N/A for this surface).
  - Control-plane data is unit-agnostic; no SI conversion (P1/S5) is involved.

